{%- comment -%}
  Maison Tavo brand faces — self-hosted Latin (+ Devanagari companion) WOFF2 only.
  No Google Fonts / fonts.gstatic remote stylesheets.
  Body: Bai Jamjuree · Accent/UI: Satoshi · Headers/highlights: Instrument Serif
  Wordmark: Noto Serif Extra Thin (100) · Specs: JetBrains Mono · Devanagari: Noto Serif Devanagari
  Preload only LCP-critical faces (body + display). Metric overrides keep fallbacks near zero CLS.
  Horizon picker font preloads omitted — brand faces override those CSS variables.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'bai-jamjuree-latin-400-normal.woff2' | asset_url | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2' }}
{{ 'instrument-serif-latin-400-normal.woff2' | asset_url | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2' }}

<style>
